{
  "$schema": "https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema",
  "$id": "urn:refund-vault:stage10:output:v2",
  "description": "Analyze only supplied excerpts. Policy template representation is independent of runtime readiness and current vault compilation. POLICY_SUPPORTED: observed core clauses have a coherent symbolic representation (formulas, relative periods, attendance/rewards allowed); unmentioned ancillary fields remain NOT_STATED, not assumed absent. CLARIFICATION_REQUIRED: conflicting amount, unspecified mission/threshold or unresolved calendar year prevents that representation. POLICY_UNSUPPORTED: general withdrawal/self-pledge/discretionary medical judgment outside the completion-refund template scope. Lack of participant wallets, signatures, registration dates or runtime observations alone must never make policy unsupported. runtimeExecutable requires verified complete runtime inputs and compatible fixed-amount four-submission profile; public documents alone cannot authorize payment. text may be a concise faithful paraphrase, preserving formulas, units, scope and exceptions. Unknown text=null. No external information.",
  "type": "object",
  "additionalProperties": false,
  "required": [
    "sourceId",
    "policyLabel",
    "policyFields",
    "clarificationQuestions",
    "unsupportedReasons",
    "runtimeExecutable",
    "runtimeMissing"
  ],
